        "cooked": "<p>This is more of a thematic/story question, but since Chris mentioned at one point that Tachyon doesn’t have a super-metabolism, meaning she has to stop mid-battle to take a snack break to make up for her running incredibly fast, is she taking damage while Pushing the Limits is in play because she’s running too fast to stop and eat anything, thus making her sick?</p>\n<p>Oh, and the fact that she has to do this makes me love her more.</p>",
